{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/321845-sardonyx-system-what-do-you-think-of-the-name","id":321845,"title":"'Sardonyx System' - what do you think of the name?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-11-25T08:34:43-08:00","id":321845,"title":"'Sardonyx System' - what do you think of the name?","content":"In a recent Monday Meeting Notes post, RichT mentioned an working title for the new OPP house rules system that will be used for the TC and Scion - the <i>Sardonyx System</i>.<br /> <br /> I was curious as to what people thought about the name? Here's the post - take a at the comments for explanation of the name: <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/thanks-for-the-requiems-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\">http://theonyxpath.com/thanks-for-th...meeting-notes/</a><br /> <br /> Its growing on me somewhat, but as it'll require explanation of what that means i'll admit I suspect a better name could be found . 'Storyteller System', was pretty much self explanatory as a name for example.<br /> <br /> Thoughts on the working title for the new system...?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#ff0000\"><b>Ad Astra</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/232-chill","name":"CHILL","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar232_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-25T10:26:02-08:00","id":321938,"title":"","content":"I think the guy running it is pretty handsome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Neall Raemonn Price</span><br /> Beleaguered Scion Developer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/137-neall","name":"Neall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1204"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-25T10:53:58-08:00","id":321963,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/314948-so-sardonyx-system-y-n\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/314948-so-sardonyx-system-y-n\"> So \"Sardonyx System - Y/N?\" - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/314948-so-sardonyx-system-y-n\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/314948-so-sardonyx-system-y-n </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> From the Monday Morning meeting (and about the only new for Scion/Trinity other than 'working on it') is that they may be calling it the Sardonyx System. I kinda of like it. </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> There's already been a bit of discussion on this on the Scion forum.<br /> <br /> The comments on the Monday Meeting are a bit crowded for this I think, so I'm hoping these threads are adequate.<br /> <br /> To sum up my feelings from the other thread, &quot;sardonyx&quot; doesn't quite have a hook in it.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-25T12:49:15-08:00","id":322080,"title":"","content":"I think if you are making rpg system that is going to be translated to multiple settings and stories, the system name should key in on what unifying element of the system carries over to every setting. For example Numenera, The Strange, and Shotguns &amp; Sorcery all use the Cypher System, with Cyphers being the objects that empower your characters in all three settings.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1522-turkeygiant","name":"turkeygiant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1522_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"999"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-25T13:02:10-08:00","id":322091,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/321845-sardonyx-system-what-do-you-think-of-the-name?p=321963#post321963\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">[URL]<br /> <br /> There's already been a bit of discussion on this on the Scion forum.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Well, that'll remind me to look there - not really interested in Scion personally so I don't think i've ever been in there. I'll take a look at that thread though, thanks for the link.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#ff0000\"><b>Ad Astra</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/232-chill","name":"CHILL","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar232_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-25T13:04:51-08:00","id":322092,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Neall</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/321845-sardonyx-system-what-do-you-think-of-the-name?p=321938#post321938\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think the guy running it is pretty handsome.</div> </div> </div> </div>I swear I first read that as 'the guy RUINING it' .... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/redface.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Embarrassment\" smilieid=\"2\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#ff0000\"><b>Ad Astra</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/232-chill","name":"CHILL","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar232_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-25T15:35:26-08:00","id":322238,"title":"","content":"TBH, I could not care any less about the name. I just want to know how it works. A rose by any other name.........","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-25T17:04:59-08:00","id":322268,"title":"","content":"I'm pretty sure most people are of that general sentiment. However the name does matter.<br /> <br /> Look at the issues with the nWOD 2e naming thing and all the confusion caused until it was officially the 2e instead of &quot;Chronicle Books.&quot;<br /> <br /> The naming issue really isn't for those of us that are already (essentially) sold on the new editions. Or at least on the concept of them. The naming issue is more for growing the games to new audiences.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}